menu "FTM responder investigation"
config FTM_RESPONDER_PROBE
    bool "Capture responder hardware and converted FTM timestamps"
    default n
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32C6
    help
        Diagnostic only, requires exact audited Wi-Fi object hashes.
        Copies timestamps after the existing driver callback and queues
        records without waiting. Formatting runs in a separate task.
config FTM_RESPONDER_RX_METADATA
    bool "Capture responder fine timestamp register fields"
    default n
    depends on FTM_RESPONDER_PROBE
    help
        Diagnostic only. Reads timestamp slots after the driver callback.
        Requires an exact stable reconstruction of both hardware timestamps.
endmenu
